<p class='text'>Apparently, I'm now a grandfather.</p>
<p class='text'>I think it's fair to say I didn't see that coming.  Growing up, my son had said he wanted a hundred children, but as an adult, not so much.  And I didn't really ever see my daughter wanting children - it seemed as much out of the norm for her as it is for me.  I probably shouldn't say this, but when she told me she was expecting a baby, I didn't honestly know if she was letting me know, or asking my opinion on what choices she had.</p>
<p class='text'>At this point, I'm not really sure what difference it's going to make in my life.  They are living in London, although they have come up here for Christmas (actually allowed this year, yay!).  We will probably end up going down there a fair bit to see them.  We'll see what happens.</p>
